{"parse":{"title":"Strength Alone Can Defend","pageid":302311,"revid":1778248,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Strength Alone Can Defend</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b1/Talent_Strength_Alone_Can_Defend.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015926\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Strength Alone Can Defend\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b1/Talent_Strength_Alone_Can_Defend.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015926\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b1/Talent_Strength_Alone_Can_Defend.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015926 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b1/Talent_Strength_Alone_Can_Defend.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015926 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Strength Alone Can Defend\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Strength_Alone_Can_Defend.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Strength Alone Can Defend.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino\" title=\"Arlecchino\">Arlecchino</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Arlecchino gains 1% All <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_RES\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental RES\">Elemental</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Physical_RES\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Physical RES\">Physical RES</a> for every 100 <a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a> she has in excess of 1,000. The maximum <a href=\"/wiki/RES\" title=\"RES\">RES</a> increase she can gain this way for each is 20%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Pyro_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pyro RES Increase\">Pyro RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hydro_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hydro RES Increase\">Hydro RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Anemo_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anemo RES Increase\">Anemo RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electro_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Electro RES Increase\">Electro RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dendro_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dendro RES Increase\">Dendro RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cryo_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cryo RES Increase\">Cryo RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Geo_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Geo RES Increase\">Geo RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Physical_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Physical RES Increase\">Physical RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental RES Increase\">Elemental RES Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Universal_RES_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Universal RES Increase\">Universal RES Increase</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Strength Alone Can Defend</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino\" title=\"Arlecchino\">Arlecchino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Alone_Can_Defend%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Strength Alone Can Defend</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">唯力量可守护</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Lìliàng kě Shǒuhù</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Only Strength Can Protect</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">唯力量可守護</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Lìliàng kě Shǒuhù</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">護れるものは力のみ</span><br /><small><i>Mamoreru Mono wa Chikara nomi</i></small></td><td>Only Strength Can Defend</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">힘만이</span> <span lang=\"ko\">지킬</span> <span lang=\"ko\">수</span> <span lang=\"ko\">있으며</span><br /><small><i>Himmani Jikil Su Isseumyeo</i></small></td><td>Only Strength Can Defend<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ko&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ko-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>• 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Solo la fuerza podr<span lang=\"es\">á</span> proteger</td><td>Only Strength Can Protect</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Seule la force peut prot<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>ger</td><td>Only Strength Can Protect</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Лишь</span> <span lang=\"ru\">сила</span> <span lang=\"ru\">защитит</span><br /><small><i>Lish' sila zashchitit</i></small></td><td>Only Strength Will Defend</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Strength Alone Can Defend</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Chỉ Sức Mạnh Mới Có Thể Bảo Vệ</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Kraft allein sch<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>tzt</td><td>Strength Alone Protects</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Strength Alone Can Defend</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Somente a For<span lang=\"pt\">ç</span>a Defende</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Yaln<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>zca Kuvvet Savunabilir</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Egida della forza</td><td>Aegis of Strength</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ko-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-ko_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><b>Korean:</b>&#160;Arlecchino's three Talents connect into a single sentence, \"Only Pain Can Repay, / Only Strength Can Defend, and / Only the Balemoon Can Know.\"</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Alone_Can_Defend%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Releas